# Stage 7 golden tour (M6, D-036 style): the real game from the title with
# the run started in Strobl (`level = strobl`, D-047): START at frame 21,
# stage intro 21..170, then the inputs of strobl_solver.replay unchanged
# from frame 171 (re-copy them after `cargo xtask solve strobl --write`;
# the xtask tour coupling test checks it), then 800 idle frames: the
# Maibaum sequence, the tally and the route map Strobl -> Bad Ischl, which
# waits (Wait from 2492) for START or its 300 frames; the tour ends in it.
# D-102 (E42): time_limit 230 (was 240): 10 s less time bonus (score
# 17300, was 17800) and a 10-frame shorter tally, so the map comes 10
# frames earlier.
# Play frame = tour frame - 171 (stage clock likewise until the goal).
# Shots, per section:
#   1 Anlegestelle   60 intro
#   2 Promenade      470 the Pension Seeblick balcony (D-100 corner post and
#                    geranium box), 558 shutter #2 opening (clock 387),
#                    618 Resi standing on shutter #3 (the D-100 HUD-band
#                    check: the surface she lands on is below the HUD band)
#   3 Dorfplatz      820 the Gasthof shutters, 955 the Postbus triggered on
#                    its way to its halt (the route passes before it stops;
#                    the halt itself is strobl_postbus_shelter's `halt`
#                    shot), 1022 the checkpoint joke „Bus 150 / hält! Voll."
#   4 Kreuzung       1180 Ampel #1 sends its first car (the route walks the
#                    street; the car stream under the terrace is
#                    strobl_ampel_watch's `car_stream` shot)
#   5 Buergelstein   1530 the walkway (decks B/C over the outflow), 1560
#                    Gelse #1 over deck C
#   6 Radweg         1736 E-Biker #1 crashed at the buffer, 1792 E-Biker #2
#                    riding at the Ache, 1900 Maibaum, 2100 tally, 2560 the
#                    route map Strobl -> Bad Ischl in Wait: both D-098
#                    alternate label slots (Bad Ischl left of its dot,
#                    Café Zauner raised), Normal form.
level  = strobl
seed   = 1
source = handwritten
start  = title
expect = complete frames=1900..1900 deaths=0 state=route_map stage=strobl score=17300 lives=3 oblaten=34
shots  = 0:title 60:intro 470:balkon 558:shutter_opening 618:shutter3 820:gasthof 955:postbus 1022:checkpoint 1180:ampel 1530:walkway 1560:gelse 1736:ebiker_crash 1792:ebiker 1900:maibaum 2100:tally 2560:route_map
